Type: Project
Package: pairwise.meta.analysis.app
Title: pmatools wizard (Shiny app for pairwise MA + GRADE)
Version: 2.1.0
Authors@R: person("Yuki", "Furukawa", email = "furukawa.y.psy@gmail.com",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: 4-step wizard around the pmatools sources (vendored under
    R/_pmatools/ rather than installed from a package, to bypass the
    shinyapps.io build server's stale GITHUB_PAT). Deployed on
    shinyapps.io. WARNING - the rare-event backends metafor, mmeta and
    BiasedUrn are referenced only as name strings in
    R/_pmatools/rare_events.R, so rsconnect's code scan cannot detect
    them; this Imports field is the ONLY thing that installs them on
    the server. Never remove them (see deploy.R and update_vendor.R).
